{"acceptance_length": 5.035714285714286, "acceptance_lengths": [2, 4, 1, 9, 3, 13, 3, 1, 3, 1, 11, 1, 4, 1, 3, 5, 8, 1, 2, 1, 4, 8, 6, 7, 7, 6, 14, 6, 2, 1, 4, 5, 7, 4, 7, 5, 1, 5, 7, 2, 2, 4, 6, 3, 1, 9, 16, 9, 16, 5, 6, 4, 2, 6, 3, 5], "allocated_memory_after_bytes": 20455006208, "allocated_memory_before_bytes": 20454988800, "benchmark": "gsm8k", "completion": "We are given:\n\n- **Goal:** $6300  \n- **Amount raised in first 3 hours:** $2100  \n- **Assumption:** The same amount is raised every hour.\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Find the amount raised per hour\n\nWe are told that $2100 was raised in 3 hours. So the **rate** (amount per hour) is:\n\n$$\n\\text{Rate} = \\frac{\\$2100}{3 \\text{ hours}} = \\$700 \\text{ per hour}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Find how many hours are needed to reach the goal\n\nWe need to find the total number of hours $ t $ such that:\n\n$$\n\\text{Total amount raised} = \\text{Rate} \\times t = \\$700 \\times t\n$$\n\nWe want this total to be at least $6300:\n\n$$\n700t = 6300\n$$\n\nSolve for $ t $:\n\n$$\nt = \\frac{6300}{700} = 9\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Final Answer:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{9} \\text{ hours}\n$$\n\nSo, the firefighters need to fundraise for **9 hours** in total to reach their goal.", "decode_seconds": 2.035115748178214, "draft_calls": 56, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 94, "method": "native_target_dflash", "output_hash": "559d461a0efa608283b075bcce0f4ce9930621c378c1f969da7efceed6c695f5", "output_tokens": 281, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20549665280, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20866662400, "problem_id": "gsm8k/5b7f6f1902a383b9", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 2075.096047949046}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "9", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 2.075096047949046, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20866662400, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20866662400, "sampling_seed": 691484337931267347, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 56, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03318481892347336, "turn_inde